cff-version: 1.2.0
title: kyverno2native
message: If you use this tool in academic work, please cite it.
type: software
abstract: >-
  Converts Kyverno policies into Kubernetes ValidatingAdmissionPolicy and
  MutatingAdmissionPolicy, covering constructs that Kyverno's own autogen
  cannot: traditional pattern syntax, CEL policy CRDs, multi-rule policies,
  and mutation policies.
repository-code: 'https://github.com/emotionalist/kyverno2native'
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - kubernetes
  - admission-control
  - kyverno
  - cel
  - policy-as-code
